WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:03.003
-Our first guest tonight
is a movie icon,

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:04.670
whose latest
film, "Halloween Ends,"

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:08.374
is in theaters and streaming on
Peacock this Friday.

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:14.013
He's also my weirdo cousin
my mom made me have on the show.

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.516
Please welcome Michael Meyers.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.218
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:21.254
[ "Halloween" theme playing ]

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.506
Why do you have a knife?

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.977
Yeah. I can already tell
this was a huge mistake.

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:45.011
Put it down.

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:52.017
Put it down or we're not
gonna do the interview, Michael!

00:00:52.017 --> 00:00:54.420
Oh, my God. Unbelievable.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.723
I told your mother --
my Aunt Edith --

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.158
I told her you
could come on the show

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:00.626
so long as you
were a normal guest,

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:03.730
and you're already
freaking everyone out.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.398
Is there anything else?

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:08.168
Are you ready to act like
a human being?

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:11.571
Oh, my God, what...

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:12.939
What are you trying to do?
Oh, my God.

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:16.876
Are you trying to trying to
throw to a clip right now?

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:21.614
You're trying to
throw to a clip?

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.616
Oh, my God.
Did you bring a clip?

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:28.688
Well, then we can't
throw to a clip

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:31.390
if you don't have
a clip, Michael.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:34.360
Oh, my God, I swear to you,
ever since we were kids

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.262
and I found your
hair collection, I was like,

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:40.065
"There is something --"
Where are you going?

00:01:40.065 --> 00:01:41.633
Michael!

00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:45.872
Michael! You cannot leave
in the middle of an interview.

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.073
This is not "The View," Michael.

00:01:48.707 --> 00:01:52.045
Oh, my God, Michael,
where did you get an ax?

00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:53.946
Can security please get
the ax from him?

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:56.615
Oh, great.

00:01:56.615 --> 00:02:00.619
Really earning your paycheck
today, Jim. Thank you.

00:02:00.619 --> 00:02:01.921
Oh, now where did he go?

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.623
Oh, my God!

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:08.661
Michael, get
down...from...the...audience!

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:12.498
If you do not, I --

00:02:12.498 --> 00:02:13.566
Michael --

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:16.602
will bring out my --

00:02:16.602 --> 00:02:18.738
Michael -- next guest.

00:02:23.175 --> 00:02:25.344
What do you mean "no"?

00:02:25.344 --> 00:02:27.580
Oh, Michael, did you do
something to our next guest?

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:33.419
Oh, my...
Are you kidding me right now?!

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:35.054
Do you have any idea
how hard it's going to be

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:38.725
to book guests when they find
out that you killed one of them?

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:41.994
-Oh, let him have his fun.
[ Laughs ]

00:02:41.994 --> 00:02:45.798
-Oh, no. God. Oh, no.
Sexy teens.

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:48.100
Oh, not the night for this.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.735
Sexy teens,
you are, like, his favorite.

00:02:49.735 --> 00:02:50.803
You've got to get out of here.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:53.072
-Oh, don't worry.

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:55.975
We're way too young
and hot to die.

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:57.576
-You guys do not know my cousin.

00:02:57.576 --> 00:02:59.078
You either got to
get out of here

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:00.980
or you got to get way less sexy.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:04.083
-Ooh-hoo-hoo! No can do, Seth.

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:06.352
-I just have a really
bad feeling about this.

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:09.021
Oh, my God!
He's right behind you!

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:10.089
Michael!

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:12.892
Look at me! Michael!

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:15.728
Michael!
Don't you even think about it!

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:16.862
No!

00:03:16.862 --> 00:03:18.965
[ Screaming ]

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:21.967
Michael, you put that neck
right back

00:03:21.967 --> 00:03:23.736
where it's supposed to be
this minute.

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:25.004
-Oh, my God!

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:27.840
-Aah! Who could have guessed
this would happen?!

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:30.476
-Michael, if you think
I'm not telling Aunt Edith

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:33.445
everything you did tonight,
you've got another thing coming.

00:03:33.445 --> 00:03:34.747
Oh, my God. Get down here.

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:37.316
Oh, my God. Where are you going?

00:03:37.316 --> 00:03:43.122
I cannot believe my mom made me
bump Jennifer Lawrence for you.

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:47.160
That's it.
We're done, Michael Meyers.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.661
Ladies and gentlemen, I am so --

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:51.730
Oh, get out of the control room!

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:55.802
Somebody's got to warn Amy,
if there's time, Alex.

00:03:59.238 --> 00:04:01.274
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:05.077
I'm so sorry.

00:04:05.077 --> 00:04:06.245
We'll be right back with

00:04:06.245 --> 00:04:08.715
Brendan Gleeson and
Colin Farrell, everybody.

